<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-text">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Who We Are</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Built for<br/>Africa's<br/>Future</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Eco Ideas Namibia</strong> is a subsidiary of Eco Ideas Corporation (USA), registered in April 2026 under Namibia's foreign company registration act. We focus on mining, mining investment, and mining consultancy across Namibia's richest mineral provinces.
    </p>
    <p>
      Upon registration, the company secured five Exclusive Prospecting Licences covering high-priority mineralisation of uranium, tin, tantalite, and lithium — critical resources for the global energy transition and advanced manufacturing.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our EPLs sit within world-class geological belts, including the Sandamap–Erongo Pegmatite Belt and the Welwitschia uranium province, placing us in direct proximity to producing mines and established mineral systems.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="about-graphic">
    <div class="about-card about-card-main">
